# Personal Info

> Template — copy to `personalinfo.md` and fill in your real values.
>
> `personalinfo.md` is the ONLY place the user's personal data lives (alongside
> secrets in `.env` and task files under `projects/`). It is **gitignored** and
> should be **`chmod 600`**. Claude reads it on demand to fill forms, make
> bookings, send calendar invites, etc. — never inline this data into CLAUDE.md
> or any other tracked file.
>
> Keep the **table labels below unchanged** — the Google connector parses
> specific rows (e.g. `First name`, `Last name`, and the `| Service | Email |`
> table). Values here are placeholders only.

## Identity & contact

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| First name | Jane |
| Last name | Doe |
| Preferred name | Jane |
| Personal email (MY_EMAIL) | jane@example.com |
| Phone | +15551234567 |
| Booking phone | +15551234567 |
| Date of birth | 1990-01-31 |
| Nationality | (your nationality) |
| Passport number | X1234567 |
| Home address | 123 Example St, Apt 4B, Example City 12345 |
| City | Example City |
| Country | US |

## Partner / household

| Field | Value |
|-------|-------|
| Partner name | John Doe |
| Partner email | john@example.com |

## Service accounts

The dedicated Claude Google Workspace account (== `<SERVICE_EMAIL>`; mirrors
`SERVICE_GOOGLE_WORKSPACE_RW_EMAIL` in `.env`). The connector flow fills this row in.

| Service | Email |
|---------|-------|
| Google Workspace / Calendar | your-assistant@gmail.com |
